WEBVTT

00:04:27.305 --> 00:04:31.976
is characterized by a tremendous amount
of corporate failure.

00:04:33.477 --> 00:04:38.232
Governments don't actually like it
when familiar old corporations fail.

00:04:38.232 --> 00:04:40.026
They prefer to do business

00:04:40.026 --> 00:04:45.072
with the taxable, already regulated
devils that they know.

00:04:46.073 --> 00:04:47.199
But that's too bad,

00:04:47.241 --> 00:04:50.786
because my personal
favorite thing about companies

00:04:50.828 --> 00:04:53.289
is that they can die.

00:04:57.043 --> 00:04:59.045
When companies die, of course,

00:04:59.045 --> 00:05:05.718
that imposes a hardship on customers,
on employees, on communities,